                verification='Run the unchanged strict checkers on supplied certificates; preserve producer/verifier separation, Source manifests, resource bounds and recorded failed metadata attempts. Scientific-bearing bodies retain their original attribution.',
                work_scope='Only F004, F009 and L026 plus their shared controller, guards and byte provenance. No full corpus, source-PDF mirror or compilation cache.')
